    <string name="about_title">About NovaOS TV</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_device">%1$s %2$s · Android %3$s</string>
    <string name="about_text">NovaOS TV brings the NovaOS look to Google TV and Android TV: TV channels, Nova Filme (free movies and series), your apps as large tiles, favorites and quick access to the TV settings. It is free software (GPL-3.0-or-later) and part of NovaOS.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">NovaOS TV collects no data and shows no ads of its own. It only uses the internet when you start a channel (the stream comes directly from the broadcaster, e.g. ARD or ZDF) or open Nova Filme (lists and preview pictures from YouTube; the videos play in the YouTube app). Favorites are stored only on this TV.</string>
